This library is intended to serve as a processing system for .fit files, providing insight focused on prominent running and cycling metrics. 

Current usage is very basic; processing a .fit file will yield a dashboard with activity map, timeseries plots, and summary metrics. 

To run the full process, run DataProcessing with the --fit parser argument pointing to the fit file you wish to process. 

One key dependency is GPSBabel. This must be installed from their (scam-filled) website. Once installed, add to PATH.
